4️⃣ Scenario-Based Interview Questions (Most Important)
Q1. Your cloud server is not reachable via SSH. What will you check?
Answer:
Check server status (running or stopped)
Check Security Group port 22 open
Check network ACL
Check correct key pair
Check firewall rules
Q2. A website hosted on your server is down. What steps will you take?
Answer:
Check server uptime
Check web service (nginx/apache)
Check CPU & memory
Check DNS
Check logs
Q3. Disk space of a Linux server is full. What will you do?
Answer:
Check disk usage (df -h)
Find large files (du -sh *)
Clean logs
Remove unused files
Expand disk if required
Q4. Users are complaining the application is slow in cloud.
Answer:
Check CPU usage
Check memory usage
Check database performance
Check network latency
Enable auto scaling
